<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <title>Cotización {{ quotation.folio }} | PrintFlow</title>
    </head>
    <body style="margin:0;padding:32px 16px;background:#f2f7f4;color:#0b1c30;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
            <tr>
                <td align="center">
                    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;">
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding:32px 36px 16px;">
                                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
                                    <tr>
                                        <td valign="top">
                                            <p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#287a4d;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">PrintFlow</p>
                                            <h1 style="margin:0;color:#0b1c30;font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;">Tu cotización está lista</h1>
                                        </td>
                                        <td width="190" align="right" valign="top">
                                            <div style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #b7d8c4;border-radius:8px;background:#f3faf5;color:#287a4d;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;text-align:center;">
                                                VIGENCIA HASTA:<br>
                                                <span style="font-size:14px;">{{ quotation.expiresAt|date('d/m/Y') }}</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                </table>
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding:8px 36px 28px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;">
                                <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Hola{% if recipientName %} {{ recipientName }}{% endif %},</p>
                                <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
                                    Adjuntamos la cotización <strong>{{ quotation.folio }}</strong> por un total de
                                    <strong>${{ quotation.total|number_format(2, '.', ',') }} {{ quotation.currency }}</strong>.
                                </p>

                                {% if presentedItems is not empty %}
                                    <div style="margin:22px 0;padding:18px;border:1px solid #dce8e1;border-radius:10px;background:#fbfdfc;">
                                        <p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#287a4d;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;">Productos cotizados</p>
                                        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;">
                                            {% for item in presentedItems %}
                                                <tr>
                                                    <td valign="top" style="padding:7px 8px 7px 0;{% if not loop.last %}border-bottom:1px solid #edf2ef;{% endif %}">
                                                        <strong>{{ item.product.name }}</strong>
                                                        {% if item.product.code %}
                                                            <span style="display:block;color:#667085;font-size:12px;">{{ item.product.code }}</span>
                                                        {% endif %}
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td align="right" valign="top" style="padding:7px 0 7px 8px;white-space:nowrap;{% if not loop.last %}border-bottom:1px solid #edf2ef;{% endif %}">
                                                        {{ item.quantity_display }}
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                            {% endfor %}
                                        </table>
                                    </div>
                                {% endif %}

                                {% if message %}
                                    <div style="margin:20px 0;padding:16px;border-left:4px solid #287a4d;background:#f3faf5;white-space:pre-line;">{{ message }}</div>
                                {% endif %}

                                <p style="margin:20px 0 0;color:#52625a;font-size:14px;">
                                    El detalle de Productos, especificaciones e importes se encuentra en el PDF adjunto.
                                    Si tienes alguna duda o requieres ajustes, responde a este correo.
                                </p>
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                        <tr>
                            <td align="center" style="padding:0 36px 32px;">
                                <a href="{{ acceptanceUrl }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 30px;border-radius:8px;background:#087c19;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">Aceptar cotización</a>
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding:24px 36px;background:#e8f3ec;color:#52625a;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left;">
                                {% include 'emails/quotations/_privacy_notice.html.twig' %}
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </body>
</html>
